---
const timeline = [
  {
    year: "1977",
    text: "Music studies at the Hochschule Graz · Freelance musician in Berlin",
  },
  {
    year: "1980",
    text: "Journey to India · Student of Osho (Bhagwan) · Beginning of spiritual practice",
  },
  {
    year: "1990s",
    text: "Music distribution · IT service at Siemens · First psychological training",
  },
  {
    year: "2010",
    text: "Founding of a company group in the field of Photovoltaics & Real Estate",
  },
  {
    year: "2025",
    text: "Focus on psychological & spiritual counselling – the essence of a lived life",
  },
];
---

<section class="about" id="about">
  <div class="about__inner">
    <div class="about__text">
      <p class="section__eyebrow">About me</p>
      <h2 class="section__title">A Life of Extremes and Syntheses</h2>
      <p>
        My life path was anything but ordinary. It is shaped by a deep curiosity
        about life in all its facets — from music through meditation to business.
      </p>
      <p>
        At 23 I flew to India to become a student of Osho (Bhagwan). This encounter
        fundamentally shaped my understanding of consciousness, stillness and the nature
        of the human being — and accompanies me to this day.
      </p>
      <p>
        From IT at Siemens to founding a company group in the field of photovoltaics
        and real estate, I learned what it means to take responsibility in the material
        world. In 2025 I ended this commitment — to dedicate myself fully to
        accompanying people.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="about__timeline">
      {timeline.map((entry) => (
        <div class="timeline__entry">
          <span class="timeline__year">{entry.year}</span>
          <p class="timeline__text">{entry.text}</p>
        </div>
      ))}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .about {
    padding: 7rem 2rem;
    background-color: var(--warm);
  }

  .about__inner {
    max-width: 1200px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: 5rem;
    align-items: start;
  }

  .section__eyebrow {
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.15em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--terracotta);
    margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
  }

  .section__title {
    font-size: clamp(1.8rem, 3vw, 2.8rem);
    color: var(--deep);
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
  }

  .about__text p {
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
    color: var(--text);
    font-size: 0.95rem;
  }

  .about__timeline { display: flex; flex-direction: column; }

  .timeline__entry {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 80px 1fr;
    gap: 1.5rem;
    padding: 1.5rem 0;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--warm);
  }

  .timeline__entry:first-child { border-top: 1px solid var(--warm); }

  .timeline__year {
    font-family: 'Cormorant Garamond', serif;
    font-size: 1.4rem;
    color: var(--terracotta);
    font-weight: 300;
    padding-top: 0.1rem;
  }

  .timeline__text { font-size: 0.9rem; color: var(--text); line-height: 1.7; }

  @media (max-width: 1024px) {
    .about__inner { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 3rem; }
  }
</style>
